            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Devkitty 1.0.0 (build 281)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Less memory in the background: when you switch to another app, Devkitty takes focus away from its terminals, so the cursor timer stops and the graphics chip can rest. In a test, memory with Devkitty in the background dropped from about 370 MB to 135 MB; your numbers can differ.</li>
<li>Focus comes back to the same pane when you return to Devkitty.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
